Package: cosmic-applet-lock-keys
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: COSMIC panel applet for Caps Lock and Num Lock
 A COSMIC panel applet that shows the current Caps Lock and Num Lock state.
 The indicators are dimmed when inactive and fully opaque when active.